$Descr User 10600 7050
encoding utf-8
Sheet 1 1
Title "150 kW Cabinet - 3x 50 kW modules + CSU (same card, third strap role) (E39/E55)"
Date "2026-09-06"
Rev "D.4"
Comp "DC-Modules 150 kW - board Cabinet interconnect, sheet 1 of 1"
Comment1 "Module 150 kW = two-board sandwich: sheet 1 AC-DC (lower) + sheet 2 DC-DC (upper), bolted DCP/DCN/PE studs + 16-way control harness"
Comment2 "Content: 3x 50 kW module + CSU carrier (E39/E55)"
Comment3 "5 functional sections - 17 components - cross-section links are global net labels; wires are pin stubs only"
Comment4 "Every component carries MPN + LCSC fields (CLASS = buy to class spec, CUSTOM = made to drawing)"
$EndDescr
Text Notes 600 6350 0    60   ~ 12
150 kW Cabinet interconnect - 1 of 1   ·   rev D.4   ·   5 sections   ·   17 components
